  "description": "Create cheerful holiday artwork with Christmas Candy Canes & Peppermint Vol. 3, a premium collection of 15 unique PNG clipart designs inspired by classic Christmas sweets. The set includes peppermint candy bouquets, candy cane arrangements, festive candy jars, gingerbread houses, Christmas baskets, wreaths, sweet holiday decorations, peppermint branches, striped candies, evergreen foliage, holly berries, pinecones, ribbons, and charming seasonal compositions. Every illustration is created in a cohesive hand-painted watercolor style, featuring realistic candy textures, soft natural shading, detailed greenery, and a nostalgic handcrafted Christmas appearance. The traditional red, white, green, cream, and warm brown color palette gives the collection a unified premium look while offering plenty of variety for different design projects. Each artwork comes as high-resolution PNG clipart with a transparent background, making it simple to layer and position in invitations, greeting cards, stickers, sublimation artwork, apparel designs, scrapbook pages, party stationery, gift packaging, printable crafts, and holiday branding. This 15-piece volume is ideal for designers seeking versatile peppermint and candy cane elements with strong seasonal appeal. High Resolution, 300 DPI. Mockup Not Included.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Create cheerful holiday artwork with Christmas Candy Canes &amp; Peppermint Vol. 3, a premium collection of 15 unique PNG clipart designs inspired by classic Christmas sweets. The set includes peppermint candy bouquets, candy cane arrangements, festive candy jars, gingerbread houses, Christmas baskets, wreaths, sweet holiday decorations, peppermint branches, striped candies, evergreen foliage, holly berries, pinecones, ribbons, and charming seasonal compositions. Every illustration is created in a cohesive hand-painted watercolor style, featuring realistic candy textures, soft natural shading, detailed greenery, and a nostalgic handcrafted Christmas appearance. The traditional red, white, green, cream, and warm brown color palette gives the collection a unified premium look while offering plenty of variety for different design projects. Each artwork comes as high-resolution PNG clipart with a transparent background, making it simple to layer and position in invitations, greeting cards, stickers, sublimation artwork, apparel designs, scrapbook pages, party stationery, gift packaging, printable crafts, and holiday branding. This 15-piece volume is ideal for designers seeking versatile peppermint and candy cane elements with strong seasonal appeal. High Resolution, 300 DPI. Mockup Not Included.</p>",
